          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.355,
            0.604,
            0.372
          ],
          "content": "**b. Who purchased the maximum number of kites?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.387,
            0.614,
            0.404
          ],
          "content": "**c. Who purchased more kites, Jasmeet or Chaman?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.419,
            0.881,
            0.453
          ],
          "content": "**d. Rukhsana says Poonam Ben purchased more than double the number of kites that Rani purchased. Is she correct? Why?**"
        },
